==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|en}} {{term|malison|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|maledictiō}}, from the past participle stem of {{m|la|maledīcō||I speak ill of}}, from {{term|male||wickedly, badly|lang=la}} + {{m|la|dīcō||say, speak}}. Compare {{term|malediction|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈmælɪzən/|/ˈmælɪsən/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
